Better Remote Commander (BRC) NOTICE
====================================

Runtime dependency
------------------
The brc-agent package depends on Desktop Commander MCP:
  @wonderwhy-er/desktop-commander 0.3.1
  https://github.com/wonderwhy-er/DesktopCommanderMCP  (MIT)
  Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Eduard Ruzga and Desktop Commander Contributors

Desktop Commander is used unmodified as a local standard MCP stdio backend.
BRC does not vendor its tool implementation. BRC-owned code provides the
self-hosted relay, device pairing/authentication, outbound agent transport,
device routing and audit.

See the installed Desktop Commander package for its complete license and
third-party notices.
